title: "Multiverse Analysis: Examining How Conclusions Vary Across Defensible Analytic Decisions (APA 2026 training session)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Buchanan
    given-names: Erin M.
date-released: 2026-10-13
repository-code: "https://github.com/doomlab/apa-2026-multiverse"
url: "https://github.com/doomlab/apa-2026-multiverse"
abstract: >-
  Slides and code for a training session on multiverse analysis: identifying
  researcher degrees of freedom, constructing a principled multiverse,
  summarizing and visualizing results, and interpreting robustness across
  alternative analytic decisions, with demonstrations in R using tidyverse,
  specr, and multiverse.
keywords:
  - multiverse analysis
  - specification curve
  - researcher degrees of freedom
  - robustness
  - open science
